EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Digging holes is actually quite an
adventure. You can find great stuff.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Once I saw a dwarf! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

